SMART Goals (Critical for EPA)

From activity (page 13) :

A good CPD goal must be:

Specific – Clear focus
Measurable – Track progress
Achievable – Realistic
Relevant – Linked to role
Time-bound – Deadline
Example (EPA-ready):

“Complete AWS Data Engineer certification within 6 months and apply learning in a live project”

